Coordinate: 33.4.5/5.6.6/5.6.10
Issued: 2026-11-07
Request (verbatim): rewrite https://github.com/wbic16/site-apertureshift-com
Status: Repo rewrite complete and verified. Live domain flip pending: apertureshift.com is served from elsewhere; host/flip is Will's step.

Notes:
- Scope ruling (Will, 2026-11-07 10:50 CST): "it only serves this mission now" — apertureshift.com / the repo serve ONLY Roads to the Future. Full rewrite, not a wing: the old site is replaced.
- Repo state at inspection (2026-11-07): public, default branch exo, last push 2026-02-15; a Feb-2026 'Aperture Shift — Developer Platform' SQ-cloud skeleton (index.html, css/, js/ auth+sq-client, domains.json multi-domain themes, version.json rally R17). Stale; nothing in it is load-bearing for the new mission.
- Rewrite plan: index.html = brick-styled Roads hub; nine-numbers.html / word-home.html / zap-zoom-echo.html = exported redesigned games; about.html = the wall of text; legal.html = privacy + terms + MIT license. Old css/js/domains.json removed in the same push. Publish route: push_tree.py via custom.github, parented on fresh exo HEAD, force disabled.

Results:
