Notes:
- 64f8eea2 is the one-commit phext support squash (151 files) on upstream 4bf3a93 (argimenes/mutable-os). Phext band = 64f8eea..4f5ddaf; SSO band = 79e65f129 + bbc39f36. Promotion policy (force-with-lease on the two emise/* bands only, main by merge, blocked while a PR is open from phext-support) put to Will for ratification 2026-11-06.
